{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id39550663"}, "name":{"label":"tara_wgtn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-18T17:14:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.81.5"}, "id":{"label":"11397039683"}, "title":{"label":"The best app, hands down"}, "content":{"label":"I’d give this app more than 5 stars if I could. \n\nFor me to keep up a personal goal, it really really really helps me if there are cute characters that I have to ‘look after’ and this app has them in spades. \n\nI usually don’t allow notifications, but I enjoy the notifications for this one, they are encouraging, informative and helpful.  Knowing that a cartoon bunny is proud of me seems a bit silly for an adult, but hey, I was quite chuffed to see that one! \n\nThe app has all the features: the ability to create custom drinks, integration with Apple Health (so my bluetooth waterbottle syncs directly to it), nice widgets, an Apple watch app, and just an overall wonderful experience. \n\nAnd the price - so cheap for something so good that is having a direct positive effect on my physical and mental wellbeing. \n\nDear developers - you’ve knocked this one out the park. Thank you for your hard work, my life is better for what you have done. 💜", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
